SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_YouWantedThis::
    .string "…Wait! Don't say a word!\p"
    .string "Your POKéMON has a memory\n"
    .string "just beyond its reach.\p"
    .string "I can help it recall a move\n"
    .string "it once could learn.\p"
    .string "Shall we look? There is no charge.$"

SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_WhichMon::
    .string "Whose memories shall we explore?$"

SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_Egg::
    .string "This little mind is still dreaming.\n"
    .string "Let it hatch first.$"

SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_NoMoves::
    .string "Its memories are clear. There are\n"
    .string "no moves for me to bring back.$"

SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_Remembered::
    .string "Ah… There it is!\n"
    .string "A memory becomes a move again.$"

SaffronCity_MrPsychicsHouse_Text_Goodbye::
    .string "Come back when a memory\n"
    .string "needs a little nudge.$"
